{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Store, Shape Your World</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own shop and stock your shelves with products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers shop according to their interests and budgets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take payments at the counter, give the correct change, and boost customer satisfaction.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/0dab9a32516cddbe8ab00c3298f4f218.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/0dab9a32516cddbe8ab00c3298f4f218.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/0dab9a32516cddbe8ab00c3298f4f218.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incubate Mysterious Eggs</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place eggs in incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, Minsgons with different traits will hatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare eggs may produce Minsgons that become the most valuable part of your collection.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/67553b702354a5ad2cbafe3b6fc6484d.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/67553b702354a5ad2cbafe3b6fc6484d.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/67553b702354a5ad2cbafe3b6fc6484d.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minsgon Hatches From Eggs</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each egg harbours a different species, personality and rarity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are cute, some are powerful, some are legendary. Only time will tell which one will hatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection and discover the most special Minsgons!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3855f9ca7f18e8b73e41e5ef8ba8be9b.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3855f9ca7f18e8b73e41e5ef8ba8be9b.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3855f9ca7f18e8b73e41e5ef8ba8be9b.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train Your Minsgons</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your Minsgons into training capsules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level them up and unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trained Minsgons gain more value and attract more visitors to your garden exhibit.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3409cb7b17cfd0c8b7f4b218a69ff79d.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3409cb7b17cfd0c8b7f4b218a69ff79d.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/3409cb7b17cfd0c8b7f4b218a69ff79d.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Into Powerful New Forms</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minsgons that grow strong enough evolve into more majestic forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution increases not only their strength but also their collectible value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare evolution forms are priceless to collectors.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/a23bb9d6bde9b5be67d133a6ed5efa28.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/a23bb9d6bde9b5be67d133a6ed5efa28.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/a23bb9d6bde9b5be67d133a6ed5efa28.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showcase Your Minsgons in a Garden Exhibit</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a zoo-style garden where you can exhibit your Minsgons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, clean, and care for them to keep them happy and healthy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell entry tickets to visitors and earn additional income from your exhibit area.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/garden?t=1766942379\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showcase Your Collection and Trade</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display the Minsgons you hatch or train in your garden or collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your rare Minsgons at your stand or keep them for yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With smart decisions, you can rise to the top in both trade and reputation!</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/f141ab8e03e0d1403708c1c1a8da5e11.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/f141ab8e03e0d1403708c1c1a8da5e11.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Store and Become the Greatest</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small shop and grow step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new areas, more shelves, and powerful incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your store the biggest and most prestigious in the city!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/10d69b85e58756ed4581e88e1344dc5f.poster.avif?t=1766942379\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/10d69b85e58756ed4581e88e1344dc5f.webm?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935270/extras/10d69b85e58756ed4581e88e1344dc5f.mp4?t=1766942379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935270?t=1766942379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co